<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 02:05:11 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>澳洲联储雅各布斯表示加息后金融状况“受到​​限制”</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/rba-s-jacobs-says-financial-conditions-restrictive-after-hikes</link><description>一位储备银行高级官员表示，在今年五次加息之后，澳大利亚的金融状况“明显受到限制”，同时也指出确定加息幅度的难度。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/rba-s-jacobs-says-financial-conditions-restrictive-after-hikes'&gt;澳洲联储雅各布斯表示加息后金融状况“受到​​限制”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：RBA’s Jacobs Says Financial Conditions ‘Restrictive’ After Hikes&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/rba-s-jacobs-says-financial-conditions-restrictive-after-hikes</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:50:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>HDBank 向全球投资者提供债券和贷款，为越南的增长提供资金</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/hdbank-turns-to-global-investors-with-bonds-loan-to-fund-growth-in-vietnam</link><description>胡志明市发展股份公司计划出售全球债券并通过银团贷款市场借款，向海外投资者寻求帮助，以满足追求雄心勃勃的增长目标的经济体不断增长的信贷需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/hdbank-turns-to-global-investors-with-bonds-loan-to-fund-growth-in-vietnam'&gt;HDBank 向全球投资者提供债券和贷款，为越南的增长提供资金&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：HDBank Turns to Global Investors With Bonds, Loan to Fund Growth in Vietnam&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/hdbank-turns-to-global-investors-with-bonds-loan-to-fund-growth-in-vietnam</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>美国关税计划强化加息押注，金价保持下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>在白宫最新的关税计划导致股市走低并强化了美联储加息的预期之后，金价保持下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;美国关税计划强化加息押注，金价保持下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Holds Decline as US Tariff Plans Reinforce Rate-Hike Bets&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着股票敞口接近上限，印度养老基金转向债券</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/india-pension-funds-pivot-to-bonds-as-equity-exposure-nears-cap</link><description>随着印度最大的养老基金接近股票投资的监管门槛，印度最大的养老基金正将更多资金投入政府债券，而当地股市也从惨烈的抛售中反弹。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/india-pension-funds-pivot-to-bonds-as-equity-exposure-nears-cap'&gt;随着股票敞口接近上限，印度养老基金转向债券&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：India Pension Funds Pivot to Bonds as Equity Exposure Nears Cap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/india-pension-funds-pivot-to-bonds-as-equity-exposure-nears-cap</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 01:30:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳大利亚击败中国在所罗门群岛的太平洋立足点</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/australia-aims-to-sign-another-deal-to-block-china-in-pacific</link><description>澳大利亚与所罗门群岛签署了一项新条约，旨在阻止中国进入太平洋，部分扭转了北京三年前在该地区取得的进展，令美国及其盟友感到震惊。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/australia-aims-to-sign-another-deal-to-block-china-in-pacific'&gt;澳大利亚击败中国在所罗门群岛的太平洋立足点&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Edges China Out of Pacific Foothold in Solomon Islands&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/australia-aims-to-sign-another-deal-to-block-china-in-pacific</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 09:01:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>澳大利亚的通货膨胀证明了澳大利亚央行的鹰派政策立场</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/australian-inflation-accelerates-even-after-rba-rate-hikes</link><description>澳大利亚10月份核心通胀意外加速，凸显了经济中持续存在的价格压力，并证实了储备银行官员的鹰派评论。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/australian-inflation-accelerates-even-after-rba-rate-hikes'&gt;澳大利亚的通货膨胀证明了澳大利亚央行的鹰派政策立场&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia’s Hot Inflation Vindicates RBA’s Hawkish Policy Stance&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/australian-inflation-accelerates-even-after-rba-rate-hikes</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 00:32:01 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>由于人工智能贸易停滞，亚洲股市下跌，黄金下跌：市场总结</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</link><description>美国科技股抛售再次引发人们对人工智能交易持久性的怀疑，导致亚洲股市回落，损失从华尔街延伸至该地区。黄金下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap'&gt;由于人工智能贸易停滞，亚洲股市下跌，黄金下跌：市场总结&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Fall as AI Trade Falters, Gold Drops: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/asian-stocks-to-slide-as-ai-trade-doubts-resurface-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 22:09:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于交易商权衡供应增加的迹象与霍尔木兹海峡周围船只遭受的袭击升级，油价下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>